        "title": "Very different and Interesting",
        "text": "We travel a lot, so we appreciate things that are unusual and interesting.  This place was both.  They prepare bodies and cremate them right on the river here.  It's quite a spectacle.  Felt weird to be watching what is normally (for us) such a private affair, but we had a decent guide who filled us in on a lot of the background.  There are also a lot of strangely and traditionally dressed people around here that were cool to see.  But note that they expect tips if you take pictures of or with them.  ",
