        "title": "Really  blessed  to visit this place ",
        "text": "Being  a Hindu  this place is spiritual  for us.if you are really lucky I feel you can get chance only to visit this place and can take blessing from Lord pashupatinath. If you are not Hindu  then not allowed to enter  the main temple. We went this temple early morning  like 7 am and at that time also crowd  was almost full.may be we were in pick season  Durga  puja time. At the entrance you wil find a big cow structure  made by copper and its look like so live. There are few temples  in this compound. Back side there is a river which is holy  river for Hindus. After coming out from temple you will find some guys  dressed  and put make up like monkey  god hanuman ji. Take some snaps wih them and they will be very happy. Overall  experience  is very good and must visit place in kathmandu Nepal. ",
