        "title": "Ghoulish and Overpriced....... Unfriendly ticket staff ~ Unsavoury subject",
        "text": "We walked down to this \"Attraction\" from the Boudhanath - pleasant interesting treck down.  \n\nThe guy at the ticket office was almost insistent that we pay extra for a tour - we didn't want a tour and he was quite unhappy about this.  We wandered down to the main temple (Not open to non Hindus) and couldn't immediateley find our way to the rest of the site and the ticketing guy is after us - wouldn't help us find the way even though we had paid an overpriced ticket - stil said we needed a tour.  Only place be were subject to such an annoyance.\n\nWe eventually found our way to the main paret of the complex - the Ghats.  OK It's interesting, but it's also pretty ghoulish with groups of tourists being quite intrusive as families burn loved ones.\n\nApart from the Ghats there really isn't much to see.\n\nIf you are short of time and long on taste suggest you give this a miss.....",
