        "text": "When you first enter the perimeter of Pashupatinath you are disoriented and tormented. You’re not sure which direction you need to take to visit the site. The price is outrageously exorbitant for tourist who can't even access the temple.Then you have beggars crawling at your knees, as well as tourist guides everywhere willing to offer you a tour at a bargaining price. Also some some people try to paint your forehead without asking your permission. \n\nI was a little disappointed.",
